sequenceDiagram
    actor Helen
    participant TP as TrackingPage
    participant TC as TrackingController
    participant OS as OrderStore

    Helen->>TP: Keep the page open
    loop Every 2 s
        TP->>TC: getTracking(token)
        alt Answer arrives
            TC->>OS: findByToken(token)
            OS-->>TC: the order
            TC-->>TP: current status
            TP-->>Helen: Status, last check time
        else Offline
            TP-->>Helen: Updates unavailable warning
        end
    end
    Note right of OS: After reconnection, the<br/>first successful check<br/>shows the status, and<br/>only then clears the<br/>warning.
